sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User as Performer
  participant Portal as Task Portal
  participant API as Backend API
  participant TS as TaskService
  participant PV as Process Variables

  User->>Portal: Open task
  Portal->>API: GET /tasks/{id}
  API-->>Portal: Task + formKey + variables

  alt formKey present
    Portal->>API: GET /forms/{formKey}
    API-->>Portal: JSON Schema
    User->>Portal: Fill form
  else no formKey
    User->>Portal: Edit/add task variables
  end

  User->>Portal: Complete Task
  Portal->>API: POST /tasks/{id}/complete\n{assignee, variables}
  API->>TS: completeTask(...)
  TS->>TS: persistTaskVariables()
  TS->>PV: syncTaskVariablesToProcess()
  TS->>TS: applyTaskOutputs()
  TS-->>API: task completed
  API-->>Portal: 200 OK
